@page swift_tutorials Tutorials

\li \subpage swift_tutorials_two_particles

Here are some very simple SWIFT tutorials:

1. The \ref swift_tutorials_two_particles "two particles orbit setup" simulates
   the Earth rotating around the Sun. So we actually have only one (free) 
   particle with a hard-coded force function. The setup allows us to study the
   AMR and the symplectic properties of the time integrator.


